{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3377340/extras/dgs.gif?t=1737443423\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Welcome to <strong>Delivery Guy Simulator</strong>, where you take on the streets of a vibrant city as a determined delivery guy! Navigate bustling city blocks, deliver all kinds of packages and rise to the top of the delivery business.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3377340/extras/1.png?t=1737443423\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Take on a variety of jobs! Whether it\u2019s hot food, fresh groceries, or important packages, deliver on time, earn big, and show everyone that you\u2019re the best in the business!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3377340/extras/dgs.delivery.gif?t=1737443423\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3377340/extras/2.png?t=1737443423\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choose and unlock vehicles that fit your style. Earn money, buy new rides and upgrade them to take your delivery game to the next level!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3377340/extras/deliveryguysimulator.vehicles.gif?t=1737443423\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3377340/extras/4.png?t=1737443423\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Check your emails, pay your bills, shop online and play games. Manage your life on your personal computer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3377340/extras/dgs.pc.gif?t=1737443423\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3377340/extras/3.png?t=1737443423\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Turn your hustle into a full-fledged business! Rent a space, set up your operations and grow your busines.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3377340/extras/dgs.store.gif?t=1737443423\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3377340/extras/5.png?t=1737443423\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Take on secret deliveries and discover a bigger role in dark side of the delivery business. No questions\u2014just deliver and explore a new path to the top. Are you ready for the challenge?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3377340/extras/dgs.specialdelivery.gif?t=1737443423\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Can you grind to the top of the delivery business? Gear up, hit the road, and prove your skills in <strong>Delivery Guy Simulator</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3377340/extras/dgswhishlist.gif?t=1737443423\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3377340?t=1737443423","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3377340?t=1737443423","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3377340/800cd4376a988db62cdd2389dce752262232c5d0/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1737443423","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steams